# tally 2.2.1 P45 (d) (P43: a decided disagreement stays the hole, also after both days): where the days of
# movements stated same are undecided, a balance after the window's end is the window's hole, since a pin
# on days that disagree gives HOLE-SAME (review g1/sm b against b_p05). Before W11: 100.00 PLN on 2026-03-31.
=== sm.tally
model sm
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-10
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place wallet: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input w: date
input d1: date
input a1: money PLN
move in1: transfers
  on w
  leg cash from world to wallet amount a1
move in2: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to wallet amount a1
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  w = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) "s"
  d1 = 2026-03-06 "s"
  a1 = 100.00 PLN "s"
  opening[wallet] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  same in1 = in2
ask b: bal(wallet, 2026-03-04), bal(wallet, 2026-03-05), bal(wallet, 2026-03-06), bal(wallet, 2026-03-31)
ask b_p05: bal(wallet, 2026-03-04), bal(wallet, 2026-03-05), bal(wallet, 2026-03-06), bal(wallet, 2026-03-31) with w = 2026-03-05
ask b_p06: bal(wallet, 2026-03-04), bal(wallet, 2026-03-05), bal(wallet, 2026-03-06), bal(wallet, 2026-03-31) with w = 2026-03-06
ask b_p07: bal(wallet, 2026-03-04), bal(wallet, 2026-03-05), bal(wallet, 2026-03-06), bal(wallet, 2026-03-31) with w = 2026-03-07
ask cn: count(m in transfers over 2026-03), sum(m.cash.amount for m in transfers over 2026-03)
ask dy: in1.day, in2.day
=== expect b b_p05 b_p06
b: (0.00 PLN, ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) not precise enough for a balance" (in1), ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) not precise enough for a balance" (in1), ?"date within window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-07) not precise enough for a balance" (in1))
  unknown day: w
  unfulfilled: in1
  unfulfilled: in2
  cut 2026-06-10
b_p05: (0.00 PLN, ?"in1 and in2 are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-05, 2026-03-06: 100.00 PLN (in1) and 100.00 PLN (in2)" (in1, in2), ?"in1 and in2 are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-05, 2026-03-06: 100.00 PLN (in1) and 100.00 PLN (in2)" (in1, in2), ?"in1 and in2 are one, but leg cash differs on 2026-03-05, 2026-03-06: 100.00 PLN (in1) and 100.00 PLN (in2)" (in1, in2))
  pinned: w = 2026-03-05
  unfulfilled: in1
  unfulfilled: in2
  cut 2026-06-10
b_p06: (0.00 PLN, 0.00 PLN, 100.00 PLN, 100.00 PLN)
  pinned: w = 2026-03-06
  unfulfilled: in2
  cut 2026-06-10
